## Root Cause
The use of MD5 for token generation is insecure and can be easily guessed or forged.

## Explanation
The patch replaces the insecure MD5 token validation with a secure HMAC-based token mechanism. Using HMAC ensures that the token is generated with a secret key, providing integrity and authenticity, making it difficult to forge.

## Patch
--- a/tmp/dvna/core/authHandler.js
+++ b/tmp/dvna/core/authHandler.js
@@ -48,7 +48,12 @@
